Z||000007||1FST2M6||11-09-2001||08:48 AM||||i'm there... full bottle, with a helmet and some Depends for the weak stomached!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Fiero Friends,<P>The next scheduled meeting of Georgia Fieros is<BR>Saturday, November 10, at American Pie Restaurant on<BR>Roswell Road one block north of I-285.  Meeting time<BR>is 1:30.  I regret that I cannot be there this time<BR>since I have to travel to South Carolina.  And I'm<BR>afraid I don't know the meeting agenda.  Ramon will<BR>likely provide a follow-up note of some kind with more<BR>info.  In case not, consider this as your final<BR>reminder!<P>Hope you can be there and hear John Willhoff's tale of<BR>the one-of-a-kind blue '85 SE.<P>Paul McKibben<BR>||||reg||1
